# The chain's first two links: SP$ Untap untaps the AI's tapped Bears, then
# GainControl moves them under the human's control with a delayed
# ChangesController trigger waiting. Nothing has changed controller since, so
# the trigger has not fired and the Bears are untapped.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 U
tapformana human 3 U
tapformana human 4 U
tapformana human 5 U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue targets 6
castspell human 1
resolvestack
